\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]\[GothicCapitalF]\[GothicR]\[GothicA]\[GothicK]\
\[GothicT]\[GothicU]\[GothicR]\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] font, but I won\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]t use that font here) "
}], "Text",
